<p>Restore yourself to full health, but take damage equal to the damage healed over <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 6, 7, 8, 8</acronym> turns. This damage is split evenly among you and all burning enemies in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 3, 3, 4, 4.</acronym> Damage you take is irresistable. Damage to enemies is fire damage.</p>